WEBVTT

00:00:01.316 --> 00:00:03.819
Everyone, do you know?

00:00:03.819 --> 00:00:10.592
We Season Fairies can make
rainfall, wind, and snowfall.

00:00:10.592 --> 00:00:13.823
We are able to control
the weather at will.

00:00:14.396 --> 00:00:17.099
Isn't that wonderful?
And so...

00:00:17.099 --> 00:00:20.728
What?
There's still time to fill?

00:00:20.836 --> 00:00:24.806
Very well. I will entertain you
with a parlor trick or something.

00:00:24.806 --> 00:00:27.509
Here I go!
Spin, spin, spin.

00:00:27.509 --> 00:00:31.411
I'm making more
spins than normal.

00:00:32.147 --> 00:00:35.717
Sugar Baby Love

00:00:35.717 --> 00:00:38.720
Kuchibiru ni

00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:43.487
Namida no rouge...

00:01:03.178 --> 00:01:06.982
Sugar Baby Love

00:01:06.982 --> 00:01:14.252
Ai nante, shiritaku naiwa.

00:01:17.793 --> 00:01:21.396
Sugar Baby Love

00:01:21.396 --> 00:01:24.399
Kuchibiru ni

00:01:24.399 --> 00:01:29.268
Namida no rouge...

00:01:32.307 --> 00:01:35.777
Mokuyo ni

00:01:35.777 --> 00:01:38.747
Bara o kai,

00:01:38.747 --> 00:01:42.683
Tegami o soete.

00:01:46.621 --> 00:01:50.292
Sugar Baby Love

00:01:50.292 --> 00:01:53.161
Yume de au.

00:01:53.161 --> 00:01:58.189
Anata wa yasashii...

00:02:25.060 --> 00:02:27.229
Oh, good morning,
Mr. Robby.

00:02:27.229 --> 00:02:30.096
Thank you for waking
me every morning.

00:02:40.242 --> 00:02:43.609
Good morning.
You look well today.

00:02:50.185 --> 00:02:54.246
Good morning, everyone!

00:03:08.303 --> 00:03:12.501
He hasn't been happy recently,
which has me worried.

00:03:12.607 --> 00:03:14.837
Hmm, let me see.

00:03:17.879 --> 00:03:21.016
Good morning, Dr. Barbara.

00:03:21.016 --> 00:03:23.576
You are very diligent,
working so early every morning.

00:03:23.752 --> 00:03:25.845
What do you think?

00:03:26.221 --> 00:03:28.416
He definitely
does not look well.

00:03:29.624 --> 00:03:32.294
I'd like to do a
full examination.

00:03:32.294 --> 00:03:34.762
Will you leave him
with me for a while?

00:03:34.863 --> 00:03:36.164
Yes.

00:03:36.164 --> 00:03:38.166
All right, come this way
to fill out the forms.

00:03:38.166 --> 00:03:39.292
Sure.

00:03:41.303 --> 00:03:43.498
Wow! A turtle!

00:03:45.006 --> 00:03:49.067
Pleased to meet you.
My name is Pepper.

00:03:49.444 --> 00:03:51.105
What is your name?

00:03:52.414 --> 00:03:58.148
So, your name is Lancelot?
What a wonderful name.

00:03:58.253 --> 00:04:01.711
So, do you feel
pain somewhere?

00:04:01.823 --> 00:04:04.155
Is it your tummy?
Or your head?

00:04:06.194 --> 00:04:08.730
What? You feel fine?

00:04:08.730 --> 00:04:11.927
But this is an
animal hospital.

00:04:12.601 --> 00:04:14.865
If you're not sick,
why are you here?

00:04:17.873 --> 00:04:20.933
What? You want
a favor from me?

00:04:24.446 --> 00:04:26.107
Oh, my.

00:04:33.688 --> 00:04:34.890
-What?
-What?

00:04:34.890 --> 00:04:37.051
Teach him how to fly?

00:04:37.192 --> 00:04:38.860
That's what he asked you?

00:04:38.860 --> 00:04:41.463
Yes. Isn't he an unusual turtle?

00:04:41.463 --> 00:04:42.731
I wish you'd have your
conference elsewhere.

00:04:42.731 --> 00:04:45.063
I wish you'd have your
conference elsewhere.

00:04:45.667 --> 00:04:49.571
Lancelot was so dreamy
about the idea of flying

00:04:49.571 --> 00:04:53.475
that his owner
thought he was sick.

00:04:53.475 --> 00:04:56.342
I intend to help him!

00:04:56.912 --> 00:04:59.540
Yeah, but can turtles fly?

00:04:59.648 --> 00:05:00.182
-Of course they can't.

00:05:00.182 --> 00:05:02.412
-Of course they can't.
-Of course they can!

00:05:04.419 --> 00:05:07.122
Ok, I think I'll help, too!

00:05:07.122 --> 00:05:08.490
Ok! Me, too!

00:05:08.490 --> 00:05:10.219
Thank you, everyone!

00:05:10.592 --> 00:05:14.763
Hey, you know it's
impossible for a turtle to fly.

00:05:14.763 --> 00:05:18.099
Yes, normally a
turtle cannot fly,

00:05:18.099 --> 00:05:21.694
but Lancelot's wish
is very strong.

00:05:22.037 --> 00:05:22.867
Huh?

00:05:23.138 --> 00:05:28.576
I believe that a strong desire
can make anything possible.

00:05:29.010 --> 00:05:32.468
That's why I'm certain
Lancelot will fly.

00:05:32.948 --> 00:05:35.075
That isn't the problem.

00:05:35.917 --> 00:05:37.953
You don't know
unless you try, right?

00:05:37.953 --> 00:05:40.188
Are you going to
oppose us, Saga?

00:05:40.188 --> 00:05:43.282
When Pepper says she will
do something, she does it!

00:05:44.559 --> 00:05:46.861
How can I put it?

00:05:46.861 --> 00:05:49.523
At any rate, it's impossible
to do the impossible.

00:05:49.631 --> 00:05:50.298
-She can!

00:05:50.298 --> 00:05:50.966
-She can!
-Can't!

00:05:50.966 --> 00:05:51.700
-She can!

00:05:51.700 --> 00:05:52.200
-She can!
-Can't!

00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:52.901
-She can!

00:05:52.901 --> 00:05:53.501
-She can!
-Can't!

00:05:53.501 --> 00:05:53.802
-She can!

00:05:53.802 --> 00:05:54.402
-She can!
-Can't!

00:05:54.402 --> 00:05:55.835
I can!

00:05:55.937 --> 00:05:57.427
You can't!

00:05:59.207 --> 00:06:03.143
Hmph! Who cares what a
stubborn girl like you says!

00:06:03.245 --> 00:06:06.840
We'll think of a plan by
ourselves to make the turtle fly!

00:06:06.948 --> 00:06:08.438
Yeah!

00:06:08.617 --> 00:06:11.313
Well, wish us luck.

00:06:12.454 --> 00:06:14.285
Uh, wait, wait!

00:06:16.658 --> 00:06:20.594
Ooh, they always have
their heads in the clouds.

00:06:26.735 --> 00:06:29.636
Well, you're eating properly.

00:06:30.338 --> 00:06:33.174
I'll have the exam results soon.

00:06:33.174 --> 00:06:36.610
I know it's cramped, but it'll
only be a little longer, ok?

00:06:41.616 --> 00:06:43.083
Ok, she's gone.

00:06:43.418 --> 00:06:47.489
Now the doctor won't
be back for a while.

00:06:47.489 --> 00:06:50.117
We'll have to get back
here before she returns.

00:06:54.362 --> 00:06:55.852
It's locked!

00:06:59.534 --> 00:07:01.195
Well, let's go.

00:07:02.570 --> 00:07:05.300
Pepper is really taking
the initiative today.

00:07:06.308 --> 00:07:10.836
Pepper loves animals.
That's why she's trying her hardest.

00:07:17.419 --> 00:07:20.786
Ok! Let the
"Make Mr. Turtle Fly" project begin!

00:07:20.889 --> 00:07:22.481
-Yeah!
-Yeah!

00:07:22.791 --> 00:07:25.560
Your wish is very strong.

00:07:25.560 --> 00:07:28.654
I'm sure it will be granted.
Let's try our best.

00:07:29.130 --> 00:07:31.121
Let's take a walk
together in the sky!

00:07:31.633 --> 00:07:34.269
Ok, let's start with Plan #1.

00:07:34.269 --> 00:07:36.737
"Mimic a Season Fairy!"

00:07:38.239 --> 00:07:40.833
Ok, listen. Start by
concentrating your feelings.

00:07:42.210 --> 00:07:43.700
Like this.

00:07:44.713 --> 00:07:47.549
Then make your
body and mind lighter.

00:07:47.549 --> 00:07:49.384
-Lighter.
-Lighter.

00:07:49.384 --> 00:07:52.820
When you become
lighter, lighter, and lighter,

00:07:54.656 --> 00:07:56.224
you fly!

00:07:56.224 --> 00:07:57.213
See?

00:07:58.760 --> 00:08:00.250
I'm flying!

00:08:00.995 --> 00:08:03.156
-Like this!
-Look! Look!

00:08:06.468 --> 00:08:08.129
You did it!

00:08:13.775 --> 00:08:16.767
I guess it doesn't work
like it does with us.

00:08:17.679 --> 00:08:20.443
Are you ok, Lancelot?

00:08:21.249 --> 00:08:22.682
Plan #2!

00:08:22.851 --> 00:08:25.513
"Get Advice From a Bird!"

00:08:26.287 --> 00:08:31.486
That is why I asked my friend,
Robby the Robin, to come.

00:08:33.294 --> 00:08:35.285
Ok. Learn by watching him.

00:08:38.833 --> 00:08:42.496
He says, "Try running to
gain the momentum to fly."

00:08:42.604 --> 00:08:43.271
-Ok!

00:08:43.271 --> 00:08:44.260
-Ok!
-Let's go!

00:08:50.578 --> 00:08:52.739
Good luck, Lancelot!

00:09:01.322 --> 00:09:03.525
Ok. Let's all
give him a push.

00:09:03.525 --> 00:09:04.958
Yeah!

00:09:05.326 --> 00:09:06.816
Go!

00:09:10.598 --> 00:09:12.088
-Lancelot!
-Lancelot!

00:09:34.656 --> 00:09:37.591
There, there.
You don't have to apologize.

00:09:38.693 --> 00:09:41.162
It isn't that easy, is it?

00:09:41.162 --> 00:09:45.064
Still, I'd like to help him fly
through the sky, like us.

00:09:49.003 --> 00:09:50.732
What a pretty dove!

00:09:52.240 --> 00:09:55.710
Really? So, she is
new to this town?

00:09:55.710 --> 00:09:59.237
Wow. It's nice to
watch her fly, isn't it?

00:10:01.883 --> 00:10:02.872
Huh?

00:10:05.620 --> 00:10:07.188
What did he say?

00:10:07.188 --> 00:10:09.588
He says he knows that dove.

00:10:10.191 --> 00:10:11.749
What? He knows a dove?

00:10:12.494 --> 00:10:18.729
And he says that she is
why he first wanted to fly.

00:10:23.838 --> 00:10:28.639
He says, "I always see that
dove flying from where I live."

00:10:29.477 --> 00:10:30.778
"I thought..."

00:10:30.778 --> 00:10:33.941
"That's wonderful.
I wish I could fly like that."

00:10:34.148 --> 00:10:36.309
"And if I could fly..."

00:10:37.519 --> 00:10:39.953
"There is something
I want to do."

00:10:41.022 --> 00:10:42.357
Something you want to do?

00:10:42.357 --> 00:10:48.193
So in order to do what you want
to do, you must fly to do it?

00:10:49.230 --> 00:10:49.964
Hey! Hey!

00:10:49.964 --> 00:10:51.829
What is it you
want to do?

00:10:53.334 --> 00:10:55.598
You won't tell us?

00:10:56.871 --> 00:11:00.141
Oh, I see!
I know what it is.

00:11:00.141 --> 00:11:01.733
Really? What?

00:11:01.843 --> 00:11:05.609
The truth is, you want to
race that bird, don't you?

00:11:05.780 --> 00:11:06.714
-Race?

00:11:06.714 --> 00:11:07.476
-Race?
-Yeah.

00:11:08.049 --> 00:11:12.110
Once you learn to do something
new, you want to test it out.

00:11:12.287 --> 00:11:14.489
I understand how that feels.

00:11:14.489 --> 00:11:17.025
Once you learn to fly, you
want to test your speed.

00:11:17.025 --> 00:11:18.860
Do you think
that's what it is?

00:11:18.860 --> 00:11:22.931
Of course! The first
time I used magic,

00:11:22.931 --> 00:11:25.024
that's how I felt.

00:11:25.833 --> 00:11:27.562
Trust me.

00:11:27.669 --> 00:11:32.902
At any rate, let's keep trying
till you can fly in that blue sky.

00:11:34.275 --> 00:11:37.733
Still, he can't fly this way.

00:11:38.780 --> 00:11:42.079
I need to come up
with a new plan...

00:11:43.518 --> 00:11:45.611
Oh, I know!

00:11:45.753 --> 00:11:47.186
What is it?

00:11:47.755 --> 00:11:51.555
I just thought of a plan!

00:11:51.659 --> 00:11:53.261
Did you say a plan?

00:11:53.261 --> 00:11:54.091
Yes!

00:11:54.295 --> 00:11:58.425
It's something I can do,
because I'm a Wind Fairy.

00:11:59.100 --> 00:12:00.624
What is it?

00:12:00.735 --> 00:12:01.869
I'll tell you...

00:12:01.869 --> 00:12:03.393
Whisper, whisper, whisper...

00:12:04.105 --> 00:12:06.007
Wow!

00:12:06.007 --> 00:12:07.634
-It's a good idea, right?
-Yeah!

00:12:07.742 --> 00:12:09.835
Are those guys ok?

00:12:10.078 --> 00:12:11.179
-He'll fly for sure!

00:12:11.179 --> 00:12:12.612
-He'll fly for sure!
-Oh, brother.

00:12:51.419 --> 00:12:54.252
It isn't going so smoothly.

00:12:55.023 --> 00:12:58.652
But I have to make
a stronger wind blow.

00:12:59.460 --> 00:13:04.864
My plan for tomorrow is to
make Lancelot fly with my wind.

00:13:08.469 --> 00:13:10.096
I'll keep trying!

00:13:11.806 --> 00:13:14.366
A strong wish will
always come true.

00:13:15.910 --> 00:13:18.936
I'm sure my wish
will come true, too.

00:13:20.782 --> 00:13:22.943
I guess strange
things happen.

00:13:23.551 --> 00:13:26.888
So you say you came to see
my inventions on your own?

00:13:26.888 --> 00:13:29.379
Huh?
Uh, yeah.

00:13:30.324 --> 00:13:32.554
So, do you really
have something?

00:13:32.660 --> 00:13:36.297
You want an invention to make
something about this big fly, right?

00:13:36.297 --> 00:13:37.730
No problem.

00:13:38.666 --> 00:13:41.931
Ta-dah! A mini helicopter with turbo!

00:13:43.071 --> 00:13:45.437
Ok, ignition!

00:13:53.114 --> 00:13:55.207
Next is a propulsion-equipped glider.

00:13:56.484 --> 00:13:57.576
Take-off!

00:14:05.660 --> 00:14:07.150
Run!

00:14:12.800 --> 00:14:14.859
Sorry about that.

00:14:15.403 --> 00:14:18.429
For the time being,
I guess these can be used.

00:14:21.609 --> 00:14:23.444
Huh? What's this?

00:14:23.444 --> 00:14:25.036
Parachute.

00:14:26.080 --> 00:14:29.106
Isn't this something for
falling rather than flying?

00:14:29.717 --> 00:14:33.121
Anyway, that's all
my flight-related stuff.

00:14:33.121 --> 00:14:34.789
I'll lend them to you.

00:14:34.789 --> 00:14:37.553
But help me out with my
inventions sometime, ok?

00:14:42.997 --> 00:14:46.734
Maybe I can use these by
combining them somehow.

00:14:46.734 --> 00:14:48.998
I hope they help
those guys out.

00:14:49.871 --> 00:14:51.463
Oh, there they are.

00:14:51.906 --> 00:14:54.136
You look exhausted.

00:14:55.409 --> 00:14:57.111
I'm all right.

00:14:57.111 --> 00:15:00.603
At any rate,
I'll help you fly today.

00:15:00.948 --> 00:15:04.884
That's right. When Pepper says
she'll do something, she does it!

00:15:05.386 --> 00:15:08.981
Once you're flying, next you'll
race the dove. Keep trying!

00:15:09.991 --> 00:15:11.481
Ok, here I go.

00:15:12.860 --> 00:15:14.794
Strong wind, blow!

00:15:19.267 --> 00:15:21.098
Strong wind, blow!

00:15:24.739 --> 00:15:27.108
This is stronger
than her usual wind!

00:15:27.108 --> 00:15:29.099
Yeah! Maybe this will...

00:15:33.347 --> 00:15:34.814
It's still not enough?

00:15:35.216 --> 00:15:39.243
But your wind was way stronger
than usual. This plan's no good, either!

00:15:40.321 --> 00:15:42.152
That's not the case!

00:15:42.256 --> 00:15:43.154
Pepper.

00:15:43.257 --> 00:15:45.159
Let me try again.

00:15:45.159 --> 00:15:47.627
My will power is strong, too.

00:15:50.765 --> 00:15:51.891
Pepper!

00:15:52.533 --> 00:15:55.730
I'm ok.
I'm just a little tired.

00:15:56.304 --> 00:15:58.005
Don't overdo it!

00:15:58.005 --> 00:15:59.996
Hey! You have to rest a little!

00:16:00.942 --> 00:16:03.544
Saga! What are you doing here?

00:16:03.544 --> 00:16:06.104
We'll talk about that later!
More importantly...

00:16:06.214 --> 00:16:08.739
This is unreasonable. Don't
push yourself so hard.

00:16:08.850 --> 00:16:11.318
But if I don't try...

00:16:13.688 --> 00:16:19.388
What? "My wish won't come true if
you have to suffer so much, Pepper."

00:16:20.194 --> 00:16:21.684
Mr. Turtle...

00:16:27.335 --> 00:16:28.825
Robby!

00:16:29.971 --> 00:16:31.871
Huh? What did you say?

00:16:37.778 --> 00:16:38.579
-It's Joe!

00:16:38.579 --> 00:16:40.444
-It's Joe!
-And that dove, too!

00:16:45.319 --> 00:16:49.585
He says, "This area is my turf.
How dare you trespass."

00:16:49.690 --> 00:16:51.180
Joe is mad.

00:16:51.292 --> 00:16:54.128
What?
The park belongs to everybody!

00:16:54.128 --> 00:16:56.130
It's nobody's turf!

00:16:56.130 --> 00:16:57.164
-Hey, Joe!

00:16:57.164 --> 00:16:59.325
-Hey, Joe!
-Knock it off!

00:17:12.613 --> 00:17:13.944
Sugar! Salt!

00:17:23.257 --> 00:17:25.122
Oh, my.
Lancelot?

00:17:28.896 --> 00:17:30.386
Lancelot!

00:17:32.233 --> 00:17:35.862
Can it be that he is
fond of the dove?

00:17:40.942 --> 00:17:42.136
I got it!

00:17:45.680 --> 00:17:47.671
Strong wind, blow!

00:17:51.319 --> 00:17:52.980
Please blow!

00:18:08.135 --> 00:18:09.170
-Look at him!

00:18:09.170 --> 00:18:10.102
-Look at him!
-He's flying!

00:18:10.404 --> 00:18:12.395
Lancelot is flying!

00:18:35.329 --> 00:18:36.364
-Lancelot!

00:18:36.364 --> 00:18:37.164
-Lancelot!
-Look out!

00:18:37.164 --> 00:18:38.756
Wait, Sugar!

00:18:39.734 --> 00:18:42.066
You guys aren't strong
enough to support the turtle!

00:18:42.670 --> 00:18:44.472
Then what should we do?

00:18:44.472 --> 00:18:47.236
This! Use the stuff in here.

00:18:48.275 --> 00:18:50.266
H-He's heavy.

00:18:50.878 --> 00:18:52.311
Can't hold on!

00:19:05.726 --> 00:19:06.920
-Sugar!
-Sugar!

00:19:06.994 --> 00:19:07.961
What?

00:19:09.296 --> 00:19:11.491
This is from Saga.

00:19:11.599 --> 00:19:12.588
Got it!

00:19:13.567 --> 00:19:15.069
-Hurry! Hurry!

00:19:15.069 --> 00:19:16.627
-Hurry! Hurry!
-It's gonna break!

00:19:26.280 --> 00:19:27.770
Lancelot.

00:19:31.619 --> 00:19:34.816
The things I borrowed
from Phil worked.

00:19:39.894 --> 00:19:42.096
Was this Saga's idea?

00:19:42.096 --> 00:19:45.497
Yeah! Saga thought of it,
and I flew with it!

00:19:45.599 --> 00:19:47.590
You two were an
impressive duo!

00:19:51.238 --> 00:19:53.672
Why are they
getting along so well?

00:19:54.108 --> 00:19:55.209
Hey, you!

00:19:55.209 --> 00:19:59.168
Once you learn to fly,
you're going to race her, right?

00:19:59.280 --> 00:20:01.145
-You're wrong.
-Huh?

00:20:01.882 --> 00:20:06.454
The real reason
Lancelot wanted to fly

00:20:06.454 --> 00:20:10.185
was so he could be
friends with the dove, right?

00:20:13.260 --> 00:20:14.522
What?

00:20:14.628 --> 00:20:17.563
You're kidding!
He wasn't a sports freak?

00:20:20.868 --> 00:20:21.802
What did he say?

00:20:21.802 --> 00:20:24.566
He says that his wish
did come true after all.

00:20:24.905 --> 00:20:27.174
But it happened...

00:20:27.174 --> 00:20:30.632
because your wish was strong.

00:20:35.483 --> 00:20:38.077
Oh? Is that
Lancelot over there?

00:20:40.554 --> 00:20:41.953
Ms. Hanna!

00:20:42.056 --> 00:20:43.887
Lancelot!

00:20:44.925 --> 00:20:48.095
Oh, Lancelot!
What are you doing here?

00:20:48.095 --> 00:20:49.926
You look so well!

00:20:51.065 --> 00:20:52.726
Um, Teacher?

00:20:54.201 --> 00:20:55.469
Miss Saga.

00:20:55.469 --> 00:20:58.029
Is that your turtle?

00:20:58.472 --> 00:21:01.532
Uh-huh, that's right.
Isn't he cute?

00:21:02.376 --> 00:21:06.437
Huh? I, well,
he suits you well.

00:21:07.214 --> 00:21:09.614
I'm so happy you like him.

00:21:11.986 --> 00:21:14.887
Oh, my! Did you
make a new friend?

00:21:16.490 --> 00:21:18.481
I see.
That's good.

00:21:30.304 --> 00:21:34.570
Pepper said that she really
appreciated what you did today.

00:21:35.309 --> 00:21:38.540
I don't need appreciation. I need
you guys to stay out of trouble.

00:21:39.246 --> 00:21:41.015
Still...
Oh, well.

00:21:41.015 --> 00:21:43.450
I learned something today, too.

00:21:43.450 --> 00:21:44.382
Huh?

00:21:44.585 --> 00:21:48.715
"If your wish is strong,
anything can come true."

00:21:48.822 --> 00:21:51.188
What Pepper said was true.

00:21:51.692 --> 00:21:52.852
Yeah!

00:22:21.222 --> 00:22:24.623
Tsuki no negai

00:22:25.626 --> 00:22:29.129
Mizu ni tokete

00:22:29.129 --> 00:22:34.501
Shiroi namiki-michi mitsuketa

00:22:34.501 --> 00:22:38.198
Hoshi-kuzu no uta

00:22:39.340 --> 00:22:47.681
Nana-iro no hashi o wataru kaze

00:22:47.681 --> 00:22:52.953
Shitte ita yo ne

00:22:52.953 --> 00:22:57.583
Kimochi tsunagu ureshisa

00:22:57.825 --> 00:23:00.094
Sugar Snow

00:23:00.094 --> 00:23:08.102
Kona-yuki mau machi ni yagate

00:23:08.102 --> 00:23:13.307
Kirei na hana saku kisetsu ni

00:23:13.307 --> 00:23:18.244
Anata o omou

00:23:19.713 --> 00:23:24.451
Kokoro o tokasu

00:23:24.451 --> 00:23:28.489
Ai wa, yume wa

00:23:28.489 --> 00:23:35.292
Sono mune ni aruno

00:23:39.767 --> 00:23:40.801
Preview of the Next Episode

00:23:40.801 --> 00:23:44.638
Preview of the Next Episode
I'm glad the turtle got to fly.
Flying feels good.

00:23:44.638 --> 00:23:49.009
Really? Hey, if I tried hard,
do you think I could fly, too?

00:23:49.009 --> 00:23:52.479
Oh, that's easy!
If you become light like me,

00:23:52.479 --> 00:23:54.982
you'll be able to zoom
through the sky! Zoom!

00:23:54.982 --> 00:23:58.440
Are you talking about
body weight or personality?

00:23:58.552 --> 00:23:59.753
Um...

00:23:59.753 --> 00:24:03.490
"A Little Snow Fairy Sugar"
The Next Episode Is
"The Tiny Guest."

00:24:03.490 --> 00:24:06.584
That isn't true.
She's way bigger than me!
